offset_right = 1152.0
offset_bottom = 648.0
text = "You lost all your hearts, but this is not the end of your journey. At least, not yet. As a mortal, you've probably noticed how fragile your life is... But 
what if you chose another path? With new possibilities? Strange adventures? The sagacity of young love? What if time happened to turn a blind eye 
to the time you have lost, making it endless? Guess you won't be able to find out right now, my Butterfly, but maybe another time? May your future 
be happy, and may those who love you be closer than ever. This is not a goodbye, just a \"Good. Bye, until then.\""

